The '''Tribe's camp''' was a temporary settlement used by [[The Tribe]] on [[Nevarro]]. It was granted to them by [[High Magistrate]] [[Greef Karga]] after they [[Pirate siege on Nevarro|successfully defeated]] the [[pirate]]s occupying [[Nevarro City]] as well as [[death|killing]] their [[Pirate King|King]], [[Gorian Shard]].<ref name="Chapter 21">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 21: The Pirate}}</ref>

While traveling to Mandalore, some of the Mandalorians were left behind at the Tribe's camp to protect the children and the people of [[Nevarro]].<ref name="Chapter 23" />

